1
00:00:02,713 --> 00:00:05,824
Deema says, “Hummy yummy,”

2
00:00:05,824 --> 00:00:09,654
“I feel something in my tummy!”

3
00:00:09,654 --> 00:00:12,606
Deema’s tummy goes rumble, rumble,

4
00:00:12,606 --> 00:00:15,638
Like a little hungry drum.

5
00:00:15,638 --> 00:00:18,670
She wants something tasty, tasty,

6
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:21,782
“Can I please have some?”

7
00:00:21,782 --> 00:00:24,814
Hummy yummy in my tummy,

8
00:00:24,814 --> 00:00:27,846
Hummy yummy, feed me, Mummy!

9
00:00:27,846 --> 00:00:30,798
Deema’s hungry, time to eat,

10
00:00:30,798 --> 00:00:32,952
Give her something good and sweet!

11
00:00:32,952 --> 00:00:34,548
Hummy yummy in my tummy,

12
00:00:34,548 --> 00:00:39,973
Hummy yummy, feed me, Mummy!

13
00:00:39,973 --> 00:00:43,005
Clap your hands and tap your feet,

14
00:00:43,005 --> 00:00:46,037
Deema says, “It’s time to eat!”

15
00:00:46,037 --> 00:00:49,069
Apples, bananas, berries too,

16
00:00:49,069 --> 00:00:52,101
Carrots make her crunch and chew.

17
00:00:52,101 --> 00:00:55,133
Cheese and toast or rice and peas,

18
00:00:55,133 --> 00:00:58,165
“Something yummy for me, please!”

19
00:00:58,165 --> 00:01:01,197
Hummy yummy in my tummy,

20
00:01:01,197 --> 00:01:04,309
Hummy yummy, feed me, Mummy!

21
00:01:04,309 --> 00:01:06,543
Deema’s hungry, time to eat,

22
00:01:06,543 --> 00:01:10,372
Give her something good and sweet!

23
00:01:10,372 --> 00:01:13,404
Hummy yummy in my tummy,

24
00:01:13,404 --> 00:01:16,436
Hummy yummy, feed me, Mummy!

25
00:01:16,436 --> 00:01:19,468
Clap your hands and tap your feet,

26
00:01:19,468 --> 00:01:22,500
Deema says, “It’s time to eat!”

27
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:25,532
Mix it, stir it, one, two, three,

28
00:01:25,532 --> 00:01:28,564
Make a yummy plate for Deema.

29
00:01:28,564 --> 00:01:31,596
Nibble, giggle, chew, chew, chew,

30
00:01:31,596 --> 00:01:33,750
Deema shares her snack with you!

31
00:01:33,750 --> 00:01:35,266
Hummy yummy in my tummy,

32
00:01:35,266 --> 00:01:40,771
Now Deema’s tummy feels so happy!

33
00:01:40,771 --> 00:01:43,803
Something healthy, something neat,

34
00:01:43,803 --> 00:01:46,835
Thank you for my yummy treat!

35
00:01:46,835 --> 00:01:49,787
Hummy yummy in my tummy,

36
00:01:49,787 --> 00:01:52,899
No more rumbling in my tummy!

37
00:01:52,899 --> 00:01:55,931
Clap your hands and sing with Deema,

38
00:01:55,931 --> 00:01:58,963
Yummy, yummy—one, two, three!

39
00:01:58,963 --> 00:02:01,995
Deema says, “Hummy yummy,”

40
00:02:01,995 --> 00:02:04,947
“Happy food inside my tummy!”
